## Agregar ciudad 

POST http://localhost:6262/ciudad HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombreCiudad":"Talca",
    "region_id_region":7
}




### Entregar ciudad
GET  http://localhost:6262/ciudad HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json


### Obtener ciudad segun id 
GET http://localhost:6262/ciudad/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json


### Actualizar ciudad
PUT http://localhost:6262/ciudad/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  
    "nombreCiudad":"Talca",
    "region_id_region":7
}


### Eliminar ciudad
DELETE http://localhost:6262/ciudad/1 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json